0'>\n<ul class='toc-indentation'>\n<li><a href='#OPS114Incidentescalationprocedure-Escalation'>Escalation</a></li>\n<li><a href='#OPS114Incidentescalationprocedure-Outofhours'>Out of hours</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div></p><h2 id=\"OPS114Incidentescalationprocedure-Escalation\">Escalation</h2><ul><li>Page the incident commander within 15 minutes.</li><li>Open a bridge and post its link in the incident channel.</li></ul><p>Who is on call is in <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://status.example/rota\" rel=\"nofollow\">the rota</a>. Pool lb_acq_01 alerts page the payments team.</p><p><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image image-center\" draggable=\"false\" width=\"600\" src=\"https://confluence.example.internal/download/attachments/embedded-page/OPS/OPS-114%20Incident%20escalation%20procedure/escalation-matrix.png?api=v2\"></span></p><h2 id=\"OPS114Incidentescalationprocedure-Outofhours\">Out of hours</h2><div id=\"expander-1786032121\" class=\"expand-container\"><div id=\"expander-control-1786032121\" class=\"expand-control\"><button type=\"button\" id=\"expand-button-1786032121\" class=\"aui-button aui-button-link aui-button-link-icon-text\" aria-expanded=\"true\" aria-controls=\"expander-content-1786032121\" ><span class=\"expand-icon aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-chevron-down\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"expand-control-text conf-macro-render\">Who approves a customer notice</span></button></div><div role=\"region\" id=\"expander-content-1786032121\" class=\"expand-content\" aria-labelledby=\"expand-button-1786032121\"><p>Out of hours, the duty manager approves any customer notice.</p></div></div>","representation":"storage","_expandable":{"webresource":"","content":"/rest/api/content/81920114"}},"_expandable":{"editor":"","view":"","styled_view":"","storage":"","anonymous_export_view":""}},"extensions":{"position":114},"_links":{"webui":"/space